"markdown": "### AnxieTea\n\nNetwork monitor and firewall for your iPhone. Your iPhone talks. AnxieTea lets you listen, and decide who it talks to.\n\nAnxieTea shows every connection your apps and system services make, and blocks the ones you don't want.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
