{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **See everything:** Live connections with app, server name, owner, country, and traffic.\n- **World Map:** Shows connection routes to every country and ranks traffic by owning company.\n- **Decide what's allowed:** Rules enforced by the kernel, Allow, Ask or Deny modes per app, plus blocklists for ads and trackers.\n- **Advanced protection:** DNS and WebRTC leak protection, HTTPS Only, VPN kill switch, Apple analytics blocking.\n- **Wi-Fi safety:** Wi-Fi Guard (rogue router warnings), Inbound Watch, devices on your network, and Bluetooth/AirTag tracker scan.\n- **Status bar meter:** Live upload/download speeds right in the status bar, with alerts when requests are blocked.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
