"class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
"markdown": "### Version 1.0.5\n- **Who runs the servers:** World Map shows company servers and ranks traffic. Tap a country for breakdown.\n- **Server details:** One page per server with owner, labels, traffic, apps, address, and rules.\n- **Block a company:** Block every network a company runs, for all apps or for individual apps.\n- **Statistics:** Review activity for the day or week (block reasons, trackers that slipped through, unencrypted traffic, overnight activity).\n- **Interface improvements:** Clear company names (Meta, Amazon...), full-screen map with double-tap zoom, and small countries and territories shown on the map.",
